WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.880
global catastrophe.

00:00:01.880 --> 00:00:04.840
He said that it will be irreversible

00:00:04.840 --> 00:00:08.180
as any nuclear holocaust would be.

00:00:08.180 --> 00:00:10.940
This is what they said at the United Nations.

00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:13.040
What happened? Here we are.

00:00:13.040 --> 00:00:15.720
Another U.N. official stated in 1989

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:17.639
that within a decade, entire nations

00:00:17.639 --> 00:00:21.680
could be wiped off the map by global warming.

00:00:21.680 --> 00:00:22.360
Not happening.

